 {"file":"server/services/rca_v4_validate.py","name":"the anchor is dropped, so a clause inside a finding counts",
  "find":"    r\"^\\s*(?:no|not|nothing|there\\s+(?:is|are)\\s+no)\\b\"",
  "replace":"    r\"\\s*(?:no|not|nothing|there\\s+(?:is|are)\\s+no)\\b\""},

 {"file":"server/services/rca_v4_validate.py","name":"`ticket` becomes a source noun, so an unusable ticket reads as a failed lookup",
